# Sentinel of Lost Lore: "Put target card you don't own in exile that has an Adventure on the bottom of its owner's library" (CR 700.2, 715.2, 401.1). Exile holds Bot1's Memnite (no Adventure), Bot1's own Giant and Bot2's Giant. Only Bot2's Giant is a legal target, so it is chosen alone and goes to the bottom of Bot2's library (its owner's), not Bot1's; Bot1's Giant and the Memnite stay.

